  "body": "Imagine waking up to uninterrupted sea views, where the horizon becomes part of your everyday backdrop and coastal living defines your day. This impressive 285sqm, three-level residence is designed for space, flexibility, and effortless family livin, perfect for growing families or multi-generational lifestyles.\r\n\r\nOffering 5 generous bedrooms and 3 well-appointed bathrooms, the home is intelligently configured across three levels to provide both connection and privacy. The upper level is the true showpiece, featuring the main living and dining areas positioned to capture sweeping sea views. Large windows invite in abundant natural light, creating a warm and inviting space ideal for everyday living or entertaining against a stunning coastal backdrop.\r\n\r\nThe mid floor accommodates two well-sized bedrooms alongside a bathroom, making it perfect for children or guests while maintaining close proximity to the main living hub.\r\nDownstairs, the lower level offers exceptional flexibility with two additional bedrooms and a separate lounge. With its own sense of space and separation, this level is ideal for extended family, teenagers, or guest accommodation-providing independence without compromising on comfort.\r\n\r\nA double garage adds practicality with secure parking and extra storage, while the multi-level design ensures everyone has their own space to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nThe real highlight, however, is the view. From morning sunrises over the water to peaceful evenings watching the light dance across the sea, this home brings nature to your doorstep every single day.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home, it's a coastal retreat that combines space, functionality, and breathtaking outlooks in one exceptional package.\r\nVendor wants action, call Tim or Vinson (021 055 2650) today to arrange your private viewing.",
